@startuml
title SSD - UC-01 - Start Focus Session

autonumber
actor Learner
participant "FocusDesktop System" as System

Learner -> System : startFocusSession(type, plannedDuration?)
System --> Learner : sessionStarted(sessionId, type, plannedSeconds, remainingSeconds)
System --> Learner : timerSnapshot(state, intervalType, remainingSeconds)

note right of System
  The system owns timer accuracy. The client counts
  locally between snapshots, polls every 30 seconds
  while running, and reconciles after reconnect.
end note

@enduml
